<title>UK: Israel Electric details $500 million bond issue.</title>
<headline>Israel Electric details $500 million bond issue.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following three bond issues were priced on Wednesday, joint lead managers Lehman Brothers and Salomon Brothers said on Thursday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ISRAEL ELECTRIC CORP</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p> AMT    $350 MLN	COUPON     7.25	MATURITY    15.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.81     PAY DATE    16.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.65	REOFFER    99.81     SPREAD	+91 BP</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  A3/A-     MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC   0.40</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.5 PCT 2006 U.S. TREASURY NOTE</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p> AMT    $125 MLN	COUPON     8.10 S/A  MATURITY  15.DEC.2096</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.827    PAY DATE    16.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.125     REOFFER    99.827    SPREAD	+145 BP</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  A3/A-     MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC   0.625</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND AUGUST 2026 U.S. TREASURY BOND</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p> AMT    $125 MLN	COUPON     7.875     MATURITY    15.DEC.26</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.555    PAY DATE    16.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.875     REOFFER    99.555    SPREAD	+125 BP</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  A3/A-     MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC   0.50</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND AUGUST 2026 U.S. TREASURY BOND</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
